window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-008-4cfc1933afbe9630.json"]={sha256:"4cfc1933afbe9630ad36182c755230c8f02d7927333d66f50130fc008a74b9a0",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-1a562210fe98eb6d","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8705.html","title":"RFC 8705: OAuth mutual TLS and certificate-bound tokens","titleEn":"RFC 8705: OAuth mutual TLS and certificate-bound tokens","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-008","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-008","related":[{"id":"security-v27-009","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8693.html"],"title":"OAuth Token Exchange：委派主體與剩餘權限預算","titleEn":"OAuth token exchange: delegated actors and remaining authority","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：同名不同金鑰樣本拒絕，換證後65%可重算；認證、受眾與憑證綁定均獨立保留，沒有以其中一項替代其他項。 交付20筆binding.csv、thumbprint編碼樣本及換證事件表；只用公開測試資料，不記錄私鑰或有效token。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reject same-name/different-key fixtures and reproduce 65% after rotation. Authentication, audience and certificate binding remain separate requirements, with none used as a substitute for another. Deliver 20 binding rows, thumbprint-encoding examples and a rotation timeline. Use public test material only, recording no private key or usable token in the shared evidence.","difference":"畫出使用者、排程服務、儲存服務與STS；逐跳列subject、actor、audience、scope及到期，區分代表誰與實際由誰執行操作。","differenceEn":"Draw user, scheduler, storage service and STS. At each hop list subject, actor, audience, scope and expiry, separating whose authority is represented from which service actually performs the operation.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["憑證綁定不能取代TLS身分驗證或token受眾驗證；代理終止TLS時，後端看到的憑證資訊必須有可信傳遞契約，不能信任任意header。 20筆已通過基本token驗證的請求中，16筆指紋一致；換證後有3筆仍攜舊token，維持相同20筆母體。 原始符合率16/20×100=80%；未同步換發token後13/20×100=65%。綁定不符的請求必須拒絕而非延用舊指紋。","本地政策要求新token剩餘時間不超過輸入token、服務上限與工作需求三者最小值；scope另取明確允許交集，時間短不會自動修正過寬scope。 輸入token剩餘900秒、服務上限600秒、工作需求420秒；第二情境工作需求保持420，但輸入token只剩240秒。 可委派期限min(900,600,420)=420秒；變更後min(240,600,420)=240秒。到期以共同觀測時刻計算。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Certificate binding does not replace TLS authentication or token-audience validation. When a proxy terminates TLS, certificate evidence delivered to the backend needs a trusted propagation contract rather than an arbitrary client-controlled header. Of 20 requests passing basic token checks, 16 have matching thumbprints. After a certificate rotation, three of those retain old bound tokens; keep the same 20-request population. Matching rate is 16/20×100=80%; unsynchronized token renewal reduces it to 13/20×100=65%. A binding mismatch is rejected rather than accepted through an old-thumbprint fallback.","The local policy bounds new-token remaining lifetime by the minimum of input lifetime, service cap and task need. Scope is separately intersected with explicit permissions; short lifetime does not repair excessive scope. The input token has 900 seconds remaining, the service cap is 600 and task need is 420. In the changed fixture task need stays 420 while input remaining lifetime falls to 240 seconds. Delegated lifetime is min(900, 600, 420)=420 seconds, falling to 240 when the input lifetime falls. Compute all remaining lifetimes against the same observation instant.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-018","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3161.html"],"title":"RFC3161時間戳：摘要、nonce與精度區間","titleEn":"RFC 3161 timestamps: imprint, nonce and accuracy intervals","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：同名不同金鑰樣本拒絕，換證後65%可重算；認證、受眾與憑證綁定均獨立保留，沒有以其中一項替代其他項。 交付20筆binding.csv、thumbprint編碼樣本及換證事件表；只用公開測試資料，不記錄私鑰或有效token。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reject same-name/different-key fixtures and reproduce 65% after rotation. Authentication, audience and certificate binding remain separate requirements, with none used as a substitute for another. Deliver 20 binding rows, thumbprint-encoding examples and a rotation timeline. Use public test material only, recording no private key or usable token in the shared evidence.","difference":"建立請求摘要、雜湊演算法、nonce及回應token描述；逐一替換摘要、nonce及TSA授權，觀察哪個契約首先失敗。","differenceEn":"Create request-imprint, hash-algorithm, nonce and response-token descriptors. Substitute imprint, nonce and TSA authorization separately, recording which contract fails first rather than collapsing every rejection into an expired-token message.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["憑證綁定不能取代TLS身分驗證或token受眾驗證；代理終止TLS時，後端看到的憑證資訊必須有可信傳遞契約，不能信任任意header。 20筆已通過基本token驗證的請求中，16筆指紋一致；換證後有3筆仍攜舊token，維持相同20筆母體。 原始符合率16/20×100=80%；未同步換發token後13/20×100=65%。綁定不符的請求必須拒絕而非延用舊指紋。","本課兩個時間戳使用同一可信時基與已宣告精度；以最早可能完成時間減最晚可能開始時間，得到可證明的最小間隔。未宣告精度不可自行當零。 第一時間戳中心1000秒、精度±2秒，第二中心1010秒、精度±3秒；簽章、摘要與nonce先假設已通過獨立檢查。 最小分離(1010−3)−(1000+2)=5秒；第二精度擴大至±6秒時只剩2秒。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Certificate binding does not replace TLS authentication or token-audience validation. When a proxy terminates TLS, certificate evidence delivered to the backend needs a trusted propagation contract rather than an arbitrary client-controlled header. Of 20 requests passing basic token checks, 16 have matching thumbprints. After a certificate rotation, three of those retain old bound tokens; keep the same 20-request population. Matching rate is 16/20×100=80%; unsynchronized token renewal reduces it to 13/20×100=65%. A binding mismatch is rejected rather than accepted through an old-thumbprint fallback.","Two classroom timestamps share a trusted time base and declared accuracy. Subtract latest possible start from earliest possible finish to obtain a defensible minimum separation. Missing accuracy must not be silently interpreted as zero uncertainty. The first center is 1000 seconds with ±2-second accuracy; the second is 1010 with ±3. Signature, imprint and nonce are assumed to have passed independent checks before applying interval arithmetic. Minimum separation is (1010−3)−(1000+2)=5 seconds. Widening only the second accuracy to ±6 leaves two seconds. Subtracting centers alone would overstate the supported temporal separation.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-4bedf7e3ed424da8","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8693.html","title":"RFC 8693: OAuth 2.0 Token Exchange","titleEn":"RFC 8693: OAuth 2.0 Token Exchange","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-9057a80251c1f13b","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3161.html","title":"RFC 3161: Time-Stamp Protocol","titleEn":"RFC 3161: Time-Stamp Protocol","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
